    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On the desolate edge of the quasi-galaxy Clauson, a planet called KX27 was once an oasis of life until a ravenous war spanning millennia dragged it into the abyss.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are Strawberry No. 14, a clone who suddenly woke up from the seaside. You have no memory, no past, only the superpowers engraved in your genes and the instinctive desire to survive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/36868e4596dd964e0ddbdbf66a8d41cb.poster.avif?t=1746159764\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/36868e4596dd964e0ddbdbf66a8d41cb.webm?t=1746159764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/36868e4596dd964e0ddbdbf66a8d41cb.mp4?t=1746159764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No. 14 can use his alienation ability to change the shape of his body and form different weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/c185ac0f394a4229687160f050968ebc.poster.avif?t=1746159764\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/c185ac0f394a4229687160f050968ebc.webm?t=1746159764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/c185ac0f394a4229687160f050968ebc.mp4?t=1746159764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No. 14 may also learn the monster's skills by absorbing the monster's corpse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole world seems to be hostile to No. 14. Can the lonely No. 14 survive in the harsh environment by using his own abilities and find a way to escape or uncover the truth of the whole thing? ?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On the desolate edge of the quasi-galaxy Clauson, a planet called KX27 was once an oasis of life until a ravenous war spanning millennia dragged it into the abyss.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are Strawberry No. 14, a clone who suddenly woke up from the seaside. You have no memory, no past, only the superpowers engraved in your genes and the instinctive desire to survive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/36868e4596dd964e0ddbdbf66a8d41cb.poster.avif?t=1746159764\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/36868e4596dd964e0ddbdbf66a8d41cb.webm?t=1746159764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/36868e4596dd964e0ddbdbf66a8d41cb.mp4?t=1746159764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No. 14 can use his alienation ability to change the shape of his body and form different weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/c185ac0f394a4229687160f050968ebc.poster.avif?t=1746159764\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/c185ac0f394a4229687160f050968ebc.webm?t=1746159764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/c185ac0f394a4229687160f050968ebc.mp4?t=1746159764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No. 14 may also learn the monster's